{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51850","headline":"帝星井 · 无名氏","name":"帝星井","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝星胡爲落此间？岂非此有子陵山。\n苍苍珉井一百丈，至今深夜光芒寒。\n野老相传是陈迹，断碑摸索苔藓斑。\n往事恍惚不可问，青山绿水空潺潺。\n（以上《舆地纪胜》八四《郢州·古迹》。\n後一首又见《古文图书集成·职方典》一一四七《安陆府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}